  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      398.17,
      546.27,
      469.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of powers vested in me by Section 20(4) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella, theMinister of Higher Education and Highways, on being satisfied that the administration of the affairs of the Eastern University,Sri Lanka have ben restored to normal conditions, do by this Order, revoke with effect from 21, January, 2016, the Ordermade by me under the aforesaid Act, and published in the Government Gazette Extraordinary No. 1947/25 of 30thDecember, 2015 appointing Professor Uma Coomaraswamy as the Competent Authority in lieu of the Vice-Chancellorof the Eastern University, Sri Lanka.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
